    "doc_text": "XIN_ENG_20051110.0109\n\nJAKARTA, Nov. 10 , 2005 (Xinhua)\n\nJakarta stocks end lower\n\n\n\n\nShare prices on the Jakarta Stock Exchange ended lower Thursday with the composite index down 9.12 points to close at 1,043.69 points.\n\nTurnovers totaled 801.37 million shares worth 1.01 trillion rupiah (101.11 million US dollars).\n\nDecliners beat advancers 70 to 31 while 64 other issues left unchanged.",
